{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "雨の日が多いね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私の髪は湿気にとても弱いのでちょっと困っちゃう"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だけど、最近可愛い傘を買ったんです☔︎\nなので少しるんるんと歩くことができます\n小さな心地良さです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わたくし、とあることを始めました。\nネギ栽培"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "小さなどんぶりの上でネギが栽培できるキットを購入してみました。\n果たして使うくらい伸びてくれるのか…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このねぎちゃんのおかげで時が進むスピードを感じています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ほんと、何事もあっという間"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "昨日はMV公開に「是非に及ばず」歌番組初披露でした！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ロック"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobiHbrBn.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "チェック"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobnntFf7.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ツンツンみーきゅん"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobkWYiNe.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こうあるべき、という固定概念に\n乃木坂46に入ってから枠の中に収まっていようとしている自分がいました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でも自分には色んな要素があるんです\n自分自身も知らない自分に出会うのが楽しみ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どんな要素も魅力にしちゃうぞ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ロックな乃木坂46も最高にします！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46が貴方の夏の最高の思い出になりますように"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobBGLTkY.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "家族写真みたい笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私も思い出、たくさん作るんだ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobh4EDo4.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こちら、ねぎさん\n手のひらサイズ\nまだ序章"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "育て〜育つのだ〜\nツアーが終わる頃にはいい感じかな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽しみ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また書くね"}], "source": "official"}